  "id": "inquisitorial-agent",
  "factionId": "agents-of-the-imperium",
  "displayName": "Inquisitorial Agent",
  "blurb": "The reach of the Inquisition extends across the vastness of the Imperium. Inquisitorial kill teams bring together agents from all strata of Imperial society, from elite soldiers to zealous priests. Together, these disparate elements combine their skills to deadly effect, enabling them to root out and destroy heretics, aliens and the servants of Chaos.",
